ON: delete is rejected\n- timestamps are timestamptz (UTC); enumerations are text + CHECK\n- hard deletes; review_logs outlive their card and deck (set null)\n- shared decks are copied into the subscriber's account (copy on subscribe)","textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"Table conventions\n- ids: UUIDv7, generated by the app (uuidv7() as the database default)\n- every user-owned row has user_id -> users ON DELETE CASCADE\n- references between a user's rows are composite FKs (x_id, user_id),\n  so a row can never point at another user's data\n- 'in use' references (deck preset, note type) are NO ACTION: delete is rejected\n- timestamps are timestamptz (UTC); enumerations are text + CHECK\n- hard deletes; review_logs outlive their card and deck (set null)\n- shared decks are copied into the subscriber's account (copy on subscribe)","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25,"labelPosition":null},{"id":"DZgS8xO35WQ7ex-VYKIu3","type":"rectangle","x":1360,"y":1660,"width":1160,"height":206,"strokeColor":"#868e96","backgroundColor":"#fff9db","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roundness":{"type":3},"roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":1103876169,"version":5,"versionNonce":810341669,"index":"as","isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"updated":1791775691050,"created":1791775691049,"link":null,"locked":false},{"id":"yYXb9q4Ei2sGXXiBTcXS1","type":"text","x":1384,"y":1684,"width":661.254,"height":150,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roundness":null,"roughness":1,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":1842279623,"version":5,"versionNonce":1735539627,"index":"at","isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"updated":1791775691050,"created":1791775691049,"link":null,"locked":false,"fontSize":15,"baseFontSize":null,"fontFamily":8,"text":"Hot path: study session (partial indexes on cards)\nReview queue  WHERE deck_id = $1 AND state <> 'new' AND suspended = false\n              AND due_at <= now() ORDER BY due_at LIMIT 20\n  INDEX cards (deck_id, due_at)    WHERE state <> 'new' AND suspended = false\nNew queue     INDEX cards (deck_id, position)  WHERE state = 'new' AND suspended = false\nReminders     INDEX cards (user_id, due_at)    WHERE state <> 'new' AND suspended = false\nHistory       INDEX review_logs (user_id, reviewed_at), (card_id, reviewed_at),\n                                (deck_id, reviewed_at)","textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"Hot path: study session (partial indexes on cards)\nReview queue  WHERE deck_id = $1 AND state <> 'new' AND suspended = false\n              AND due_at <= now() ORDER BY due_at LIMIT 20\n  INDEX cards (deck_id, due_at)    WHERE state <> 'new' AND suspended = false\nNew queue     INDEX cards (deck_id, position)  WHERE state = 'new' AND suspended = false\nReminders     INDEX cards (user_id, due_at)    WHERE state <> 'new' AND suspended = false\nHistory       INDEX review_logs (user_id, reviewed_at), (card_id, reviewed_at),\n                                (deck_id, reviewed_at)","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25,"labelPosition":null},{"id":"n9H3nthnUWzk6J_Pb8DqB","type":"text","x":314.656,"y":190.75,"width":50.687999999999995,"height":22.5,"strokeColor":"#ffffff","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roundness":null,"roughness":1,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":429577063,"version":6,"versionNonce":748742789,"index":"au","isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"updated":1791775691051,"created":1791775691050,"link":null,"locked":false,"fontSize":18,"baseFontSize":null,"fontFamily":8,"text":"users","textAlign":"center","verticalAlign":"middle","containerId":"lpzTtSYwta8LwmTpCyrPU","originalText":"users","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25,"labelPosition":null},{"id":"Qtg9nnYw4sLGCpiCsAKSH","type":"text"